# ============================================================
# PRIME System — Frontend Environment Variables Template
# ============================================================
#
# 1. LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (Vite dev server)
#    These are preconfigured in .env.development:
#    VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
#    VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:3000
#
# 2. PRODUCTION (Vercel)
#    Add these in Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
#    VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api
#    VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
#
# SECURITY NOTE:
# Never put database passwords, JWT secrets, or Firebase keys in frontend env files.
# All VITE_* variables are publicly exposed in the compiled browser JavaScript.
# ============================================================
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:3000
